{"seq":2,"slug":"weather-transitions","title":"天气过渡","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/foundations/weather-transitions","wordCount":1215,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"天气过渡\">天气过渡</h1><p>真实的天气从不瞬切。乌云压境要几分钟，雨停后地面要慢慢晾干，雾要一点点抬升。<a href=\"weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a>给出的是「目标状态」，但玩家眼里那段从晴到暴雨的渐变才是天气可信度的来源。这一篇专讲过渡：如何在两组参数预设之间插值、用什么曲线、不同参数为何要用不同的过渡速度、以及当过渡进行到一半被打断时该怎么办。把过渡做对，是廉价提升天气质感的最高杠杆点之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-参数插值而非状态切换\">核心概念：参数插值而非状态切换</h2><p>过渡的本质不是「从状态 A 跳到状态 B」，而是「把当前参数从 A 的预设连续推向 B 的预设」。状态标签可以在过渡一开始就改成 B（用于逻辑判断），但参数要花一段时间走完。设过渡时长为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>，已用时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span>，归一化进度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>T</mi><mo>∈</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u = t / T \\in [0,1]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>，则任一参数的当前值为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo>+</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>B</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>A</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p(u) = p_A + (p_B - p_A) \\cdot f(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 是过渡曲线，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(0)=0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(1)=1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span>。线性 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(u)=u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 最简单但起止生硬；多数项目用平滑步 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(u)=u^2(3-2u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 让过渡两端柔和。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[当前参数 A] --&gt; B[过渡控制器]&#10;  C[目标参数 B] --&gt; B&#10;  B --&gt; D[进度 u = t/T]&#10;  D --&gt; E[曲线 f u]&#10;  E --&gt; F[插值: pA + pB-pA · f]&#10;  F --&gt; G[输出当前参数]&#10;  G --&gt; H[降水/风/雾/光照下游]\">flowchart TD\n  A[当前参数 A] --&gt; B[过渡控制器]\n  C[目标参数 B] --&gt; B\n  B --&gt; D[进度 u = t/T]\n  D --&gt; E[曲线 f u]\n  E --&gt; F[插值: pA + pB-pA · f]\n  F --&gt; G[输出当前参数]\n  G --&gt; H[降水/风/雾/光照下游]</pre><p>下表对比几种常用过渡曲线的手感与适用场景：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>曲线</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>起止手感</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>线性</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f(u)=u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>起止突兀</td>\n<td>调试、风速等不敏感参数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>平滑步 smoothstep</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>u</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^2(3-2u)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>两端柔和</td>\n<td>通用首选</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓出 ease-out</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mi>u</mi><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1-(1-u)^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"mclose\"><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>起快收慢</td>\n<td>雨势骤起</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>缓入 ease-in</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>起慢终快</td>\n<td>雾气渐浓</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"各参数异步过渡\">各参数异步过渡</h2><p>天气过渡最容易被忽略的细节是：不同参数应该用不同的时长与曲线，而不是用同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>u</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">u</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">u</span></span></span></span></span> 同步推进。现实里乌云先来、雨后到、地面最后才湿透；如果所有参数同时到位，过渡会显得机械。正确做法是给每个参数配独立的过渡通道：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"csharp\" data-code=\"class TransitionChannel {&#10;    public float duration;          // 该参数独立时长&#10;    public AnimationCurve curve;    // 该参数独立曲线&#10;    float elapsed;&#10;    public float Evaluate(float from, float to, float dt) {&#10;        elapsed = Mathf.Min(elapsed + dt, duration);&#10;        float u = curve.Evaluate(elapsed / duration);&#10;        return Mathf.Lerp(from, to, u);&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;// 云量过渡 8 秒先行，降水 20 秒跟上，湿度 60 秒最慢\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>class TransitionChannel {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float duration;          // 该参数独立时长</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public AnimationCurve curve;    // 该参数独立曲线</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    float elapsed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    public float Evaluate(float from, float to, float dt) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        elapsed = Mathf.Min(elapsed + dt, duration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        float u = curve.Evaluate(elapsed / duration);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Mathf.Lerp(from, to, u);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 云量过渡 8 秒先行，降水 20 秒跟上，湿度 60 秒最慢</span></span></code></pre></div><p>典型的暴雨来临顺序：<code>cloudCover</code> 最先涨（天先暗），<code>windSpeed</code> 紧随（起风），<code>precipitation</code> 再起（开始下），<code>wetness</code> 最慢（地面逐渐湿透并积水，这部分的视觉由<a href=\"../presentation/wetness-surface\">湿润与表面响应</a>负责渲染）。这种错峰让一场雨有了「过程感」而非「开关感」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"被打断的过渡\">被打断的过渡</h2><p>最棘手的情况是过渡进行到一半时目标又变了——正转雨时剧情突然要求转晴，或玩家从室外跑进室内导致局部天气覆盖切换。绝不能直接跳到新目标，那会产生可见的参数突跳。正确做法是把「当前实际参数值」作为新过渡的起点，重新计算到新目标的过渡：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[过渡进行中 u=0.4] --&gt; B{收到新目标?}&#10;  B --&gt;|否| C[继续原过渡]&#10;  B --&gt;|是| D[读取当前实际参数值]&#10;  D --&gt; E[以当前值为新起点 A&#39;]&#10;  E --&gt; F[重置 u=0 推向新目标 B&#39;]&#10;  F --&gt; G[平滑无跳变]\">flowchart TD\n  A[过渡进行中 u=0.4] --&gt; B{收到新目标?}\n  B --&gt;|否| C[继续原过渡]\n  B --&gt;|是| D[读取当前实际参数值]\n  D --&gt; E[以当前值为新起点 A']\n  E --&gt; F[重置 u=0 推向新目标 B']\n  F --&gt; G[平滑无跳变]</pre><p>这要求过渡控制器始终持有「当前求值结果」而不只是「起点预设」。一个健壮的实现把每个参数的当前值缓存下来，任何打断都从缓存值续接。这一点对网络同步尤其重要：被打断的过渡如果起点不一致，不同客户端会演化出不同的中间天气，相关一致性问题见<a href=\"../practice/weather-networking\">天气网络同步</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"过渡触发的瞬时事件\">过渡触发的瞬时事件</h2><p>有些过渡不是渐变而是瞬时事件，最典型的是雷电。雷暴状态下，闪电是离散触发的脉冲：按泊松过程随机定时，每次触发一个极短的强光（由<a href=\"../presentation/weather-lighting\">天气光照影响</a>渲染）加一个延迟的雷声（由<a href=\"../presentation/weather-audio\">天气音效</a>按光声时间差播放）。光声延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 与距离 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 的关系约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>340</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t \\approx d / 340</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/340</span></span></span></span></span> 秒（声速约 340 米每秒），用这个延迟能让玩家下意识判断雷击远近，是极廉价的沉浸感。</p>\n<p>这类瞬时事件要和连续过渡分开管理：连续过渡走插值通道，瞬时事件走独立的触发器，二者都由过渡层统一调度，避免散落到各个表现系统里各自计时。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>过渡是参数插值而非状态切换；状态标签可先改，参数要花时长 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span> 走完。</li>\n<li>smoothstep 是通用首选曲线，敏感参数（雨势骤起、雾渐浓）可换缓入缓出。</li>\n<li>各参数异步过渡：云先暗、风后起、雨再下、湿最慢，错峰带来「过程感」。</li>\n<li>被打断的过渡必须以当前实际值为新起点续接，绝不跳变；这对网络一致性是硬约束。</li>\n<li>雷电等瞬时事件走独立触发器，按光声延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>≈</mo><mi>d</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>340</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\Delta t \\approx d/340</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">Δ</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord\">/340</span></span></span></span></span> 制造距离感。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>过渡的起点与目标来自：<a href=\"weather-state-machine\">天气状态机</a></li>\n<li>局部覆盖切换也会打断过渡：<a href=\"regional-weather\">区域与局部天气</a></li>\n<li>湿度过渡的视觉落地：<a href=\"../presentation/wetness-surface\">湿润与表面响应</a></li>\n<li>插值曲线是动画的通用工具，更系统的讨论见<a href=\"../../game-animation-systems/\">游戏动画系统</a></li>\n<li>被打断过渡的一致性需要确定性保证：<a href=\"../../game-replay-determinism/\">游戏回放与确定性</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"天气过渡","id":"天气过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：参数插值而非状态切换","id":"核心概念-参数插值而非状态切换"},{"level":2,"text":"各参数异步过渡","id":"各参数异步过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"被打断的过渡","id":"被打断的过渡"},{"level":2,"text":"过渡触发的瞬时事件","id":"过渡触发的瞬时事件"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"天气状态机","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/foundations/weather-state-machine"},"next":{"title":"区域与局部天气","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-weather-systems/foundations/regional-weather"}}